//? Title: Postman sort: actual byte buckets and insertion fallbacks
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
The native sorter processes unsigned 32-bit keys by most-significant bytes and
stably distributes each range into its actual buckets. Small ranges use the
historical insertion cutoff 32. The tiny example explicitly sets that cutoff to
zero to expose the byte mechanism; the original examples use the unchanged
default. Actual node records contain the histogram and prefix offsets used by
the producing pass. Synthetic unsigned words make the byte distribution and
range controls directly inspectable.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

$$ b(x,s)=(x\mathbin{\gg}s)\ \&\ 255,\qquad s\in\{24,16,8,0\}. $$

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/postman_sort_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <datamunge/plot/plot.hpp>
#include <datamunge/plot/diagram.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/modular_exponentiation.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/integer_arithmetic.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
#include <algorithm>
#include <cmath>
#include <limits>
#include <climits>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/number_theory.hpp>
#include <numeric>
#include <numbers>
#include <random>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <map>
#include <set>
#include <array>
#include <tuple>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/prufer.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/flow_diagram.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/postman_sort.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");

    a::PostmanOptions o;
    o.insertion_cutoff = 0;
    auto t = a::postman_sort_trace({0x02000000, 0x01000000, 0x02000001, 0}, o);
    const auto &root = t.nodes[0];
    std::print("\n| actual root byte | actual count | actual start offset |\n| ---: | ---: | ---: |\n");
    for (std::size_t i = 0; i < 256; ++i)
        if (root.counts[i])
            std::print("| {} | {} | {} |\n", i, root.counts[i], root.offsets[i]);

    g::Diagram d;
    d.node("n0", {0, 0}, std::format("Actual root shift\n{}", root.shift));
    d.node("n1", {10, 0},
           std::format("Actual root counts 0,1,2\n{},{},{}", root.counts[0],
                       root.counts[1], root.counts[2]));
    d.node("n2", {20, 0}, std::format("Actual sorted words\n{}", t.run.sorted));
    d.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    d.save_svg("build/postman_sort_tiny.svg");
}
```
