definitions plus9 changed legend definitions;10 hovers;56287 independent
records/278204 checks;frozen compatibility for all ten algorithm families;13
checkout/installed standalone headers and linked consumer;40 executed
programs/40 reviewed figures with both exports. The legacy source is retired
only after these gates pass.

The final selected-work panel displays log10(actual selected events+1), so the
two-word case stays visible beside the8000-word cases; its table retains every
raw count.
